    - target: {fileID: 942285873142114573, guid: deab37c5841dcbd489e440fc6e268145, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Player Characters are often thought of as races. The prefab contains
        the model and many other components to tweak and confgure.


        Two
        important ones are the <b>Player Character Entity</b> which determines available
        classes, and the <b>Player Character Model</b> which determines animations
        and equipment slots.


        In the Tiny Epic demo, there is one available
        Player Character.'
